<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Prague bourse closed Monday for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Prague bourse closed Monday for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Prague Stock Exchange (PSE) was closed on Monday as the country observed the public holiday, the day of the creation of a Czechoslovak state.</p>
<p>Last Friday, the PSE closed down 10.5 points, or 1.97 percent, at 521.3.</p>
<p>The PSE will re-open on Tuesday at its reglarly scheduled time.</p>
</text>
